BILINGUAL.EN:
Formulate compound queries that retrieve the following information:
the names of all people who are supervised by Ben Bitdiddle, together with their addresses;
all people whose salary is less than Ben Bitdiddles, together with their salary and Ben Bitdiddles salary;
all people who are supervised by someone who is not in the computer division, together with the supervisors name and job.

